<title>UK: SuedwestLB sets 2.0 bln FRF 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>SuedwestLB sets 2.0 bln FRF 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead manager CDC and Credit Agricole Indosuez.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWEST LANDESBANK CAPITAL MARKETS PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SUEDWESTLB GIROZENTRALE</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    19.AUG.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.036   PAY DATE    19.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.386    SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS/LUX PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC   1.65</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 8.50 PCT 2008 AND 6.5 PCT</p>
<p>			    2011 OATS</p>
<p>		NOTES     ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
